      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanda ng'ucheeda geaw dageascheeda fuga gheeh Sawli sea fuga gheeh Dawdi; ak ghwanyas Dawdi uurda muuchi, nea gooshealeada uurda Sawli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Dawdi sijiilsa aba Hebroni: duweacheadaanyi geeguura Amnoni was ghaamwat Ahinoamu, bea ng'eanyiida Yesreeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda deaba iyeenya geeguura Gileabu, was orjeeda Abigaeli was masinung'weanda Nabali bea Garmeli; nea deaba samwagu geeguura Absalomu was orjeeda Maaka was hudeaba Dalmayi was sugoocheanda Geshuri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea deaba ang'wan, geeguura Adoniya orjeeda Abitali; nea deaba muut, geeguura Shefatiya was orjeeda Abitali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea deaba lah geeguura Itreamu bea Eglaheeda was gatmooda Dawdi. Suh geejiilsa Dawdi aba Hebroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abneri gaguuyi sea Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda aba damani gwanda ng'ucheeda dageascheeda fuga gheeh Sawli sea fuga gheeh Dawdi, abeeda ghwanyas Abneri uurda aba gheeh Sawli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Sawli gwandeawa gwealeeda siguura gheawungaaschi Rispa, was hudeaba Aya; ak ghwalamda Ishbosheti ak gwayeesha Abneri, “Ghwasaan inyas guwi heeda gwealeeda gweanu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanyareas muuchi Abneri aba badayda ng'asheega Ishbosheti, ak gwayeesha, “Neada aniini geawooschi uhuuda gudeeda Yudahi? Askweareani geasisi mureeda gheeh Sawli was gweanu, ea heeda orjooga ghaamwat, ea buweadeagaaschi, ak ea mwayiinyi geatinga Dawdi, ak ghamneawa goowoowsean aba badaydeaba gatmooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ASEETA simana Abneri ng'asheanji ea suuk gea naawa suh, iimeasisiini Dawdi gidaksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dageandeawa sugoocheanda gheeh Sawli, ak ghaamiindi hoorgeeda Dawdi goombal Israeli nea goombal Yuda, ghang'eada Dani ea ghwahita Beer-sheba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaraay Ishbosheti gwarukusa Abneri ng'ashaan nuut, aba gideaba ghoawal niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Abneri giijasoodiga heeda Dawdi aba Hebroni ak gwayeesha, “Ng'eanyiini gabeang'a? Eesina neajeeda sea aniini, ak ging'ulayi geatindeanyu gaygwanda badaydaang'u ak ghaanung' ghapka fuga sean bea Israeli headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha, “Ghwadoabiiw; gaydasin neajeeda sea ang'iing'i; ak geagasayi ng'asheanjagi aba headaang'u; nea gideaba, mwaydaaha gheanyangeasu, ea eaghus ghanyi eani Mikali, was hudeaba Sawli, aba damanda uwuni daahana gheanyangeasu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta Dawdi giijasoodiga heeda Ishbosheti orjeeda Sawli, ak gwayeesha, “Goonean gatmoodeanyu was Mikali eanyeari dimbaji bughala bea fuga Filisti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta Ishbosheti buuneeda ghoareat Baltieli baleanda Laisheeda was siyeedeaba gatmooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goodeayi siyeadaanyi sea niny nea gooyeawdeada, ak ghwaat geeshta ea ghwahita Bahurimu. Hean ghwalamda Abneri ak gwayeesha niny, “Una biikta”; ak gabiikta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabalool Abneri sea gweargwa Israeli, nea gwayeesha, “Ghayi googaseadayi Dawdi ghoah sugoocheandeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa asina ng'asheanji; aba gideaba nirukuna badayda Dawdi gideaba, ‘Aba geatinda siideanyu was Dawdi gaydalealu fugeasu was Israeli aba geatinga fuga Filisti, ea aba geatinga weajoodiga nyaawa sean.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa Abneri fuga Benjamini, ak gawa Abneri eara heeda Dawdi ak gwarukusa aba Hebroni ng'asheega sean miyaasiin aba madeeda fuga Israeli, ea aba madeeda fuga sean bea gheeh Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Abneri heeda Dawdi aba Hebroni nea goodeana fih diktam, ak gwasissa Dawdi ghweelmeeda Abneri sea fuga mideawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Abneri ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Gaydang'eat dawa, ak ghaabwadi geat fuga sean bea Israeli ghapka heeda ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, ak gwasin neajeeda sea ang'iing'i, ak abeeda giimbali buuneesean bwariiy gurooroadaang'u.” Hean ghwanung' Dawdi gawa Abneri nea ghabeawa hoyyoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abneri geebwar ghami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiigu fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi sea Yoabu nea gwaleabu lugooda, nea gweadu easanga saang'a. Nea abeeda Abneri ea madeayi sea Dawdi aba Hebroni, aba gideaba ninung' gawa, nea ghabeawa hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu Yoabu sea fuga sean was lugooda mideawa, geeyeesha Yoabu, “Abneriheeda was orjeeda Neri ghwahidu heeda sugoocheanda, ak ea ninung' gawa, ak gawa nea ghabeawa hoyyoo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Yoabu heeda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha, “Neada ang'iing'i ea nisini naaha? Ng'ula, Abneri ghwaan headaang'u; neada ghwasaan inyas giidawi beata, ak ea nuwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i ginali gideaba Abneri orjeeda Neri ghwaan gwareenganeey, ak ghwanal riteaydaang'u ea hinoadaang'u nea ghwanal ng'asheega sean iisini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghabeawa Yoabu madeeda Dawdi, goojeakta giijasoodiga ghwaat geeshta Abneri, ak geeteelna heeda healadeeda Sira; nea abeeda Dawdi ea mwanala gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gabiikna Abneri Hebroni, ghwasach Yoabu niny aba jeeda dooshta ak ghwaat makcheameeda, ak ghang'ut jeeda, ak ghami, aba badayda foojeanda Asaheli was orjeeda ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
