          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Dawdi iita, gwayi, “Aniini ea sugoocheanduumeedeanyu maygwanda munyinda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA damanda manda muudeanooda aba badayda foojeanda Abneri orjeeda Neri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa goobissa uhuuda Yoabu, ea dea fuga gheanyaawa sean; ak gidabal ea manda aba gheeh Yoabu siida mabearji mananda, ghana dea bearji udamusuura, ghana dea eada bileangida, ghana dea sibwara ng'uta, ghana dea mandeawana daghwarda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwar Yoabu sea Abishayi was orjeeda ghaamwat Abneri, aba gideaba nibwar orjeeda ghaamwat was Asaheli aba ng'ucheeda Gibeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
